# BEADS runtime is handled by .beads/.gitignore (created by `bd init`).
# Do NOT exclude .beads/plans/, .beads/context/, .beads/knowledge/, or .beads/issues.jsonl
# from this root .gitignore — those are the metaswarm workflow's portable, cross-machine
# state and MUST be committed so other clones (and future you on a new laptop) can recover.

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
.beads-credential-key

# Real Claude Code transcripts must never be vendored as test fixtures.
# Synthetic fixtures do NOT use `.real.` in their name; a fixture named
# `*.real.*` is ignored by git (sessions-spike design §9.2 — defense-in-depth;
# the load-bearing guard is the marker-line assertion in fixture-guards.ts).
packages/sessions/src/__tests__/fixtures/*.real.*
